#. assessTriage.rules.1.0
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:195
msgctxt "text:assessTriage.rules.1.0"
msgid "The live festival slip adds {value0} expected aid or clinic presentations."
msgstr "祭典運行票は救護・受診 {value0} 人を追加予測。"

#. consultationNote/0
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:225
msgctxt "tree:consultationNote#/0"
msgid ""
"Eirin separated the complaint into treatable parts and returned “probably "
"fine” for revision."
msgstr "永琳は主訴を処置可能な部分へ分け、「たぶん平気」を書き直しに戻した。"

#. consultationNote/1
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:225
msgctxt "tree:consultationNote#/1"
msgid ""
"Reisen completed wavelength and lunar triage; Tewi returned the token to a "
"different drawer."
msgstr "鈴仙が波長・月相トリアージを完了。てゐは番号札を別の引出しへ戻した。"

#. consultationNote/2
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:225
msgctxt "tree:consultationNote#/2"
msgid ""
"The infirmary treated reversible injuries first and referred the file to "
"Eientei with three exclamation points."
msgstr "本部保健室が可逆的損傷を先に処置し、感嘆符三つで永遠亭へ照会した。"

#. local.0.name.yes
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:360
msgctxt "text:local.0.name.yes"
msgid "On-device patient"
msgstr "端末内患者"

#. local.0.note
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:365
msgctxt "text:local.0.note"
msgid "This token came from on-device triage and remains until consultation is completed."
msgstr "この番号札は端末内トリアージから作成。診察完了まで保存される。"

#. clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.author
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:402
msgctxt "text:clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.author"
msgid "Eientei Lunar Pharmacy"
msgstr "永遠亭月薬調剤室"

#. clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.title
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:403
msgctxt "text:clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.title"
msgid "Prescription {value0} dispensed; recount anything Tewi handled"
msgstr "処方 {value0} 調剤済み・てゐ経由分は再計数を"

#. clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.body
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:404
msgctxt "text:clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.body"
msgid ""
"Dispensed: {value0}. The bag uses bell, corner, and daylight units; do not "
"add those units together."
msgstr "今回：{value0}。薬袋の単位は校鐘・角・日照。三種を独自に合算しないこと。"

#. clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.author
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:416
msgctxt "text:clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.author.2"
msgid "Campus Hospital Recovery Corridor"
msgstr "校医院回復廊"

#. clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.title
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:417
msgctxt "text:clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.title.2"
msgid "{value0} complete; patient and observer differ by one box on “fully recovered”"
msgstr "{value0}完了・「完全回復」は本人と観察者で一欄不一致"

#. clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.body
#: src/js/clinic-model.js:418
msgctxt "text:clinicCommunityPosts.0.2.body.2"
msgid ""
"All four steps are stamped. Bring the original slip if symptoms recur; Aya’s "
"clipping is not a medical-record copy."
msgstr "四段階すべて押印。再発時は原票を持参。文の切抜きは診療録控えではない。"
